title: 밤_5_택배_서은표_영문
---
(I decided to take a job loading and unloading parcels to make some quick cash.)
(I put on my gloves and worked hard moving boxes.)
(My back is starting to ache.)
(After working hard, I took a short break to slack off for a bit.)
(As I turned my head, I saw a familiar figure near the next conveyor belt.)
(Tall, bobbed hair... is that EunPyo?!)
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
(EunPyo is working hard.)
(Soon, it was break time.)
(I approached EunPyo.)
{name()}: EunPyo?
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_shock_ver2>>
EunPyo: !!
<<show pyo_blush_ver2>>
EunPyo: Uh... {name()}.
{name()}: I didn't expect to see you in a place like this.
EunPyo: Y-yeah, me neither...
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
EunPyo: I didn't think you'd recognize me...
{name()}: How did you end up working here?
<<show pyo_neg2_ver2>>
EunPyo: Well... I guess I needed some quick cash?
{name()}: Same here.
(EunPyo... was she really in a situation where she needed quick cash?)
(I thought she lived in a nice apartment and never seemed to lack anything.)
(Well, she must have her reasons. I brushed the thought aside.)
{name()}: Isn't it exhausted? I feel like I would've collapsed if it weren't for the snacks.
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: Tell me about it. I'm just pushing through by treating it like a strength workout.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 60>> 
    <<show pyo_blush_ver2>>
    EunPyo: Still, it's nice to see you outside of school......
    EunPyo: You still smell so good...
<<endif>>
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: Let's hang in there and finish the shift.
{name()}: Yeah. Good luck to you too.
<<end>>
===